ProjectALife.DialogueShards["barks_party_1"] = {
{"PARTY_JOIN_ELSEWHERE","",{"Aren't you already with another group? Settle that first","You've got people of your own, square that before you ask us","Hold on, you're already running with someone else","One crew at a time, friend"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_ELSEWHERE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Aren't you with somebody else already? I'm not stealing anyone's people, sorry","You're already with a group, you can't just hop around, that isn't fair","You've got people already, go back to them first","You already belong to somebody, go back to them","You belong to another group already, you can't hop around","Go back to your own people, they'll be missing you"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_ELSEWHERE","reg=law,swat",{"You belong to another unit, settle that first","You're attached somewhere else, I'm not poaching","You're attached to another unit","You're attached elsewhere, resolve that first"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_ELSEWHERE","reg=military,elite",{"You're already assigned, clear that first","Negative, you've got a unit, return to it","You have a unit","Unit of assignment, report to them"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_ELSEWHERE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"You're with another crew, don't try to double-dip, go home","Already running with somebody, kid, make up your mind","You run with someone else, make up your mind","You've got a crew, kid, don't double dip"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_DANGER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Not now - look around, they're all over - ask me when it's quiet","Please, not while those things are this close","Ask me again once we're clear of this","Not now!! Not now, can't you see what's happening?! Ask me later, please","Oh God, this is a terrible time, I can't think, ask when it's calm, alright?","We're in the middle of something, I can't decide this right now, I'm sorry","Not while we're in danger, I can barely think, give me a minute, a real minute","After this, after this, if we live through this, ask me again","Please, not now, I'm trying to keep my people alive!","Right now?! We're a little busy not dying, ask later!","Are you blind?! Ask me later!","You picked a terrible time, ask me when it's calm","Not while they're right there, I can't think!"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_DANGER","reg=law,swat",{"Not while we're in trouble - stand by","Ask when this settles","Not now, we've got trouble, ask me when it's quiet","Hold that thought, there's a situation, later","Can't talk about it, we're busy, later","Not now","Not now, we've got a situation"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_DANGER","reg=law,swat|world=road",{"Wrong time, eyes on the street first"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_DANGER","reg=military,elite",{"Not while this is happening. Ask later","Hold that thought until the area's secure","Later - watch your sector","Negative, we're under threat, ask later","Not now, mission first, then personnel","Stand by, there's a threat, ask when it's clear","Not now, situation active","Stand by, situation active"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_DANGER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"You really picking now? Ask later","Not with that crawling over here","Not now, dumbass, we've got problems, later","Ask me when the shooting stops","Bad timing, kid, bad timing, hold on","Not now, dumbass","Bad timing, kid"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_DANGER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|world=road",{"Bad timing - shut up and watch the street"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_DANGER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Not NOW!! We're in the middle of something, ask me later, please!","Oh God, can't you see what's going on? Later, LATER!"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_DANGER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Bad timing, ask again when we're not being hunted","Later, we've got problems"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_LEADER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"I'm not really part of a group, I can't speak for anybody","Sorry, there's no one to ask, I'm out here on my own, more or less","That isn't mine to decide, and I don't have anyone who does","I'm not really in charge of anything, sorry, I'm just trying to survive too","I don't have a group, I'm on my own, just like you, sorry","I don't make those decisions, I'm just a person standing here","I'm not with anybody, sorry, wish I could help you","You want to talk to somebody who runs things? That's not me, I'm nobody","I'd be lying if I said I could let you in, I can't, I'm alone out here too","I'm not in charge of anything, I'm sorry","I don't run a group, I'm barely running myself","Wrong person, honestly, I'm a nobody","I'm not in charge of anything, I'd be a terrible leader","Talk to somebody else, I'm just trying to keep my head down","I don't have a group, I don't have anything, sorry","Wrong person, friend, I follow orders, I don't give them"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_LEADER","reg=law,swat",{"I'm not part of a unit you can join","No chain of command here to ask","Not my call, and there's nobody above me","I don't run a group, I'm a one-man show, sorry","Not my call, I'm not the one who decides, talk to my sergeant","I don't command anybody, sorry","I'm not the commander, speak to the chief"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_LEADER","reg=military,elite",{"I'm not attached to a unit, can't take you","No orders to bring anyone in","Ask whoever's leading us, I'm just trying to keep up","I'm not in command, speak with my CO","Not my decision, I'm just a grunt, find the leader","Not my call","Not my call, talk to my CO"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_LEADER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"I don't run a crew - ask somebody who does","It's just me, no crew to join","Not my crew to give, there's no crew","I don't run anything, {g:pal|lady}, go bother the boss","Ask somebody who gives a damn, I don't","Do I look like a boss?","Boss is the one you want, not me"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_OPINION","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"I don't know you well enough yet - ask me again after we've talked a little","Not yet, I've got people to look out for, and I only just met you","Maybe later - give it a few days and let me see how you carry yourself","I don't know you yet, give me a day or two, okay? I'm not trying to be rude","Hey, I want to say yes, I do, I just... I need to see how you act first","Not yet, not yet, I'm sorry, ask me again in a bit, once we've talked more","I'd love to but I've been wrong about people before, bad wrong, you understand?","Let me get a good look at you first, then we'll see","We only just met, give it a while... don't take it personal, I mean","I can't say yes to someone I know nothing about, you get that, right?","Maybe later, hang around, show me who you are","I just met you ten minutes ago, how do I know you won't steal my shoes?","Not yet, I'd like to see how you handle yourself, no offense","I've got people depending on me, I can't risk a stranger, yet","Ask me tomorrow, once you've proven you're not a lunatic","Come back in a couple days, show me what you're made of","I want to say yes, I really do, but my gut says wait","I don't know you well enough to put your name next to mine","I know nothing about you, give me a couple of days, and I'll tell you if I trust you","No offense, but you could be anyone, you could be a murderer","I'd love to say yes, but I need to watch you first"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_OPINION","reg=law,swat",{"Not yet, I don't take people I haven't watched","I've got nothing on you either way, that's not enough","Come back when I know what you're about","I have nothing on you, good or bad, that's not enough, come back later","I don't know you, that's exactly the problem, so, no","Prove yourself first, then ask again","No record, no reputation, no deal, come back when you've got one","I need to see you in action before I vouch for you","No record, no history, no entry"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_OPINION","reg=military,elite",{"Negative for now, I don't know you","No, trust gets earned out here","Not until I've seen you work","No. I don't know you. Trust gets earned","Not yet, I need more than a handshake","Don't know you from Adam, ask again later","You're an unknown, I don't take unknowns","Trust is earned, not requested","Your service record is blank, impress me","Unknown personnel are not admitted, earn trust first","No data on you, standby"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_OPINION","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Who are you again? Nah - not yet","I don't run with strangers - hang around, maybe","Eh, you haven't done anything for me yet","I don't know you, so no, get lost for now","Who are you again? Yeah, no, not yet, work for it","Prove you're not a snake, then we talk","Not yet, kid, I got my crew to think about","You haven't earned that yet, kid","Not yet, come back with a story I like","You haven't done anything for us yet, kid, do something","Prove you're worth the oxygen first","Never seen your face before, scram, come back with a name"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_OPINION","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Oh, um, I don't know you yet, can you give it a day or two? I'm sorry, I'm just careful","I want to say yes, I really do, but I need to know you first","Maybe later, maybe, once we've talked more, is that okay?","I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm just not sure, can you give me time?"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_OPINION","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"We just met, hang around a few days, then we'll talk","I don't take people I haven't watched, and I haven't watched you","Not yet, kid, earn it"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_OPINION","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=veteran",{"Not yet"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_OPINION","reg=family",{"Give it time, dear, we'll see","Child, we've only just met, sit and talk with us a while first"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_ROOM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"We're packed already, any more and we can't feed everyone","There's no room, we have too many mouths as it is","I wish I could, but there isn't enough food or floor for one more","We're packed tight as it is, I'm so sorry, there's no room, we can't feed another mouth","I wish I could say yes, honestly I do, but we're full up, not an inch to spare","I'd take you in a heartbeat if we had the beds, we don't, I'm sorry","We're full, there's no more room, believe me, I hate saying that","There's no space, we've barely got enough food as it is, I'm sorry, I really am","Not right now, we're maxed out, ask again if someone leaves","Aw hell, I hate this, we can't take anyone else, we're bursting at the seams","We're crammed like pickles in a jar, there's no space, I'm so sorry","Every bed is taken, every blanket, every spoon, I'm sorry","I wish I could, we've barely got enough air as it is","There's no more room in the lifeboat, sorry","We'd gladly take you if we had the food, we don't"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_ROOM","reg=law,swat",{"We're at strength, can't take another","No room, we'd be tripping over each other","Full roster, maybe another group needs you","We're full, every seat, every ration, I can't take anyone else","No room, sorry, try another group","Team's at capacity, can't add another","Team's full, sorry","The squad's at capacity, try another"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_ROOM","reg=military,elite",{"We're full up, no room for more","No slots, we can't carry more than we've got","Too many already - find another unit","Squad's at strength, no vacancies","Negative, we're full, find another unit","No more slots, that's final","No slots available","No slots, no rations, no room"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_ROOM","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"We've got enough mouths - go bug somebody else","No room, too many hands in the cans already","Crew's full - don't take it hard","We're full up, kid, try the next crew","No room, we're stacked on each other already","Ha, there ain't a spot left, sorry","Place is full, kid, take it up with the boss"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_ROOM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"I'm so sorry, we're completely full, I wish I could squeeze you in, I really do","There's just no space, we're stacked like sardines, I'm so sorry","I'd take you in a heartbeat, but we're packed in as it is"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_ROOM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"No room, no food, no beds, ask another group","We're at capacity, sorry"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_ROOM","reg=family",{"We're bursting, dear, bless you for asking"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_ROOM","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|world=building",{"Full house, kid, try next door"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_ROOM","reg=family|world=building",{"We're packed to the rafters, dear, perhaps the next group"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_TRUST","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"No, after what I've heard about you? No","Sorry, I can't, folks around here don't trust you, and neither do I","I don't think so, something about you worries me","No, I'm sorry, I've heard things about you and I can't, I just can't, not with the kids","I don't think so, people talk, and what they say about you scares me","Please don't be offended, but no, I can't have you around us","No way, after what I heard, no way, I'm sorry, goodbye","Oh God, no, I know who you are, please just go","I'd say yes if I hadn't heard what you did, but I did, so no","You're not coming near us, I mean it, go find somewhere else","That's a no, and please don't make me say it twice","I've heard things about you, bad things, and I'm sorry, I can't","No, no, I know your face from the stories, please just go","My gut says no, and my gut's been right every single time","We've got children here, I can't risk it, please understand","After what you did to that family? Absolutely not","You may be a decent person underneath, but I can't take the chance","Everyone says you're dangerous, I can't ignore everyone","There's a story going around about you, and it's not a nice one","I wish I could trust you, I really do, but I can't","We have kids here, kids, can't you understand that?","Not after what happened at the last place, no"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_TRUST","reg=law,swat",{"No, I know your kind of trouble - move along","Not a chance, I don't take people I'd have to watch all night","Not with your record around here","Not a chance, you're on my list, keep walking","I know your name and I know your record, the answer is no","After what you've done? Absolutely not","Stay away from my group, I'll say it once","Your name is on a report on my desk, the answer is no","I don't recruit people I might have to arrest","Your reputation precedes you, and not favorably"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_TRUST","reg=military,elite",{"Denied, you're a liability","No, I won't have you in my line of fire","Not happening - keep your distance","Denied, you're flagged, move along","No. I don't trust you enough. Step away","Not with that reputation, you're not coming near this unit","No, and if you ask again I'll treat it as a hostile act","Denied, reputation inadequate","You are a security risk, request denied","Security risk, denied"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_TRUST","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Ha - no, you'd sell us for a can of beans","No way, I've heard what you do","Beat it, we don't need your kind of problem","Ha! You? After what I heard? Go to hell","We don't take rats, kid, beat it","No way, I heard what you did, we'd all end up dead","Nah, you're bad news even for us, scram","You're too hot, kid, the cops would be on us by dawn","Ha, no way, you'd sell us out in a heartbeat","You smell like trouble, even for us"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_TRUST","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|rep=good",{"I want to trust you, I do, but I've got too many people counting on me, I'm sorry"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_TRUST","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Please don't be mad, but I'm scared of you, and I can't join with someone I'm scared of"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_TRUST","reg=family",{"I'm sorry, dear, but the Lord tells me no, and I've learned to listen"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_TRUST","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|rep=worst",{"No!! No no no, I know who you are, I know exactly who you are, GO AWAY","Not you, anybody but you, please go, please"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_TRUST","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|rep=bad",{"I've heard what you did, and no, I won't have it near my family","Your reputation says it all, the answer's no","Sorry, but I can't trust someone who's done what you've done"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_TRUST","reg=law,swat|rep=worst",{"You're a wanted person, the answer's no, now put your hands up"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_TRUST","reg=law,swat|rep=bad",{"No, and I'll have you know your name's on a list"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_TRUST","reg=military,elite|rep=bad",{"Denied, you are flagged"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_TRUST","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|rep=worst",{"Ha! We'd all be dead in a day, get out of here"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_NO_TRUST","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|rep=bad",{"No, you're too hot, you'd get us all killed"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Come on in, {name}, there's room, we could use the hands","Come on, then, fair warning, we move when the light is good","Welcome aboard - don't wander off and don't get us killed","Yeah, come on, we could use somebody else, God knows we could, welcome","Oh thank God, another living person... c'mon, stick with us","You're in, and I'm not just saying that, I mean it, we're glad you're here","Sure you can, we got a spare blanket and half a can of peaches","Fine by me, but what we find gets split, no hoarding","Hell yes, the more the merrier, we've been talking to ourselves for days","Sure thing, sit with us, tell us where you've been, I'm dying to hear a new voice","Okay, you're with us, don't wander off, don't be a hero, just be here","You're staying? Good, good... I mean it, I feel better already","Yes! Yes, of course, welcome to the... whatever we are, the group, welcome","You seem willing to help. That's enough for me, you're in","Honestly? We're short on hands, and you've got two, welcome","You look honest, and I've been wrong before, but I'll take the chance","Can you shoot? No? Can you carry? Yes? Great, you're in","Come on, we've got a spare mattress, well, half a mattress","You know what? Yes, yes, I need somebody to talk to besides Gary","We're headed to a safer spot, you can tag along, but keep up","Stick with us, and if it goes bad, split left, we'll find you","Welcome to the group, we're nobody special, but we're alive","I like you, don't ask me why, I just do, you're in","I'll vouch for you to the others, don't make me look stupid","Sure, as long as you're okay with canned corn for every meal","Fine, you're in, but you're taking the worst watch","You're hired, as it were, no pay, great benefits, mostly death","Please, please stay, we've been so alone, please stay","Come on in, we've got room, and we've got hearts, kind of","You can stay with us. We'll figure something out","Hell, why not? We were running out of people to complain to","You're quiet, I like quiet, welcome","I won't lie, I was hoping you'd ask, welcome home","You're hired, as the group's official worrier"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_OK","reg=law,swat",{"Fall in, you're with us now - keep your head down and your hands where I can see them","All right, you follow the group, you follow my lead - clear?","You're in, {name} - stay on my left and don't shoot anything I haven't","You're with us, keep your head on a swivel and your mouth shut when I say so","Welcome aboard, you take orders from me out there, we clear on that?","You're in, but you watch your sector, I'm not babysitting","We're short anyway, take the left side and stay off the radio","Come on then, deputy-for-a-day, don't make me look stupid","You're attached to this group, I'll tell you who to trust and who not to","Stay close, shoot what I tell you to shoot, we'll get along fine","Fall in, deputy, stay on my left, shoot only when I say","Welcome to the team, don't embarrass me","You can run with us, if you follow orders and don't shoot at shadows","You're a deputy now, congratulations, here's a flashlight","Good, we need somebody who can keep a clear head under pressure","You're attached to my patrol, stick close and learn quick","Alright, sign on, you're in, here's your shift","Fine, you're in, don't make me regret it, and don't touch my coffee"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_OK","reg=military,elite",{"You're attached - stay in the column, watch your sector, and don't freelance","Fine, fall in behind the last man - questions after we stop","Welcome to the squad, {name} - try to keep up","You're attached, fall in behind the last man and keep up","Copy, you're in, stay on my six and don't go freelancing","Welcome, report to the sergeant, watch your fire discipline","You move when we move, you stop when we stop","Affirmative, glad to have another set of eyes, keep your muzzle down","You're in, don't make me regret vouching for you","You're with us, rations are shared, watches are shared, mistakes are not","You'll do, fall in","Welcome to the squad, watch your sector, don't freelance","Fall in, trooper, don't make me repeat myself","Fall in, you're attached, report to the sergeant when we stop","Welcome, we move at oh-four-hundred, be rested","But you carry your own weight, and your own rations","Good, we're short on people with a pulse, welcome","You're in, and you're expendable, but only if it saves the rest of us, understood?","You're in, no questions, no excuses","You're attached to us now, don't wander off"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_OK","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Yeah, all right - don't make me regret it, you eat what you carry, mostly","You're in, cross us and you'll wish the dead got you first","{name}, you're in, another gun's another gun - keep up","Heh, welcome aboard, but cross us and you'll wish the dead got you first","Welcome to the crew, we eat what we steal and we steal what we eat","Sure, why not, another gun is another gun, just don't pull it on me","You're in, kid, don't be late for supper, I hate cold beans","You're in, then, and you better not run when it gets ugly, got it?","You can tag along, but you pull your weight or you're out on your ass","Good, I like that you asked, most just try to take it","Hahaha, why not? we're all going to hell together anyway","Hell yeah, welcome to the family, bring your own bottle","You're in, kid, but one wrong move and I bury you personally","Another soul for the pot, welcome to the stew","Join us? Sure, but you start by cleaning the cookpots, welcome","You're in, kid, we eat, we drink, we steal, we repeat","Another gun is another gun, sit down, take a bottle","But if you rat on us, I'll skin you personally","Welcome to the gang, the pay is lousy, but the stories are great","You look mean enough, you're in","Hahaha, welcome to the madhouse, kid","Come on in, we're drunk, but friendly"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_OK","reg=law,swat|hour=4,9",{"Fine, get in line, we move at first light, don't make me regret this","Welcome to the unit, we meet at dawn, we eat when we can"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"YES!! Oh my God, yes, come on, come with us!","Oh my God, really? Okay, okay, welcome, welcome, I'm so happy, I'm gonna cry","Stick close, I'll introduce you... they're nice, mostly","You're in, you're in, don't make me regret it, and don't leave, okay?","Finally, someone who doesn't want to rob us, welcome aboard","Yes!! Yes yes yes, please, stay, I don't want to be the youngest anymore","Thank goodness, I was hoping you'd say that","Seriously? You'd join us? We're not very good at this","Yes, YES, stay, please... I'm so tired of crying by myself"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"You're in, but you pull your weight, nobody rides free","C'mon, and mind your mouth around the others","We need the hands, so quit talking and grab a bag","Welcome, I guess, don't make me regret it","You're in, you're in, but if you steal my socks I'll kill you"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=veteran",{"You're in, follow my lead","Welcome, stay sharp"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_OK","reg=family",{"Oh honey, of course you can, we'd love the company","There's always room for one more at our table","You'll need a bowl and a spoon, we've got extras, welcome home, dear","Our door's open, our table's set, there's always one more chair"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_OK","reg=law,swat|tmp=veteran",{"You're in, don't speak unless spoken to"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_OK","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"You're in, don't waste my time"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_OK","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Heh, fresh meat, welcome, don't cry on my boots","Hahaha, a new toy, sure, join, join, we'll break you in gently"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|world=road",{"Deal, you watch the kids, I watch the road, everybody wins"}},
{"PARTY_JOIN_OK","reg=family|world=road",{"You can't sleep in the road, come in, we'll fatten you up"}},
{"PARTY_KICK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"I'm sorry, {name}, we can't keep traveling with you - please go","This isn't working, you need to leave the group","I don't trust you any more - go on, leave us be","That's it, I'm sorry, but you're done, you can't stay with us, please go","I can't have you around anymore, not after that, leave, please, just leave","No more, I'm sorry, we're not doing this, we can't trust you, go","You're out, and I mean it, get away from us before somebody gets hurt","Please go, I don't want to do this but I will, go on, go","That's it, pack up and go, you've worn out your welcome","I'm sorry, but I can't keep covering for you, please leave","You almost got us killed, and I can't forgive that","We trusted you, and you ruined it, go on, go","It's not working, I'm sorry, you have to go","You crossed the line, and I can't forgive that, go","You made your choice, now live with it, out","I don't care where you go, as long as it's away from us"}},
{"PARTY_KICK","reg=law,swat",{"You're done with this group, {name} - walk","Out - now, before this gets worse","I'm cutting you loose - don't follow us","You're out, effective now, don't follow","That's enough, you're dismissed from this group, now go","We're done, turn around and walk away","You're dismissed, go on","You're out, effective immediately","Get out, you're no longer welcome"}},
{"PARTY_KICK","reg=military,elite",{"You're out, collect your gear and go","You're no longer attached to this unit","Get gone, {name}, that's an order","You are removed from this unit, move out","Dismissed, do not follow, do not look back","You're out, final, go","Removed from the unit, leave now","You are discharged from this unit, depart now","You are dismissed, with prejudice"}},
{"PARTY_KICK","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"You're done - get lost","We're through, {name} - don't be here when we pack up","Out, and don't come sniffing around","Get the hell out, you're done with us, don't come back","You're through, kid, scram before I change my mind","Beat it, you're not part of this crew anymore","Out, now, before I do something you'll regret","Get out, you worthless sack of crap","Out, now, before I use you for target practice","Out, rat, before I cut you"}},
{"PARTY_KICK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"I'm so sorry, I'm so, so sorry, but you can't stay with us, please go","Please leave, please, I can't do this, you're scaring us","I'm so sorry, I don't want to do this, but you have to go"}},
{"PARTY_KICK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"That's enough, you're out, pack your stuff and go","You blew it, I'm sorry, but you blew it"}},
