{"PARTY_LAG","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"{name}, keep up! We can't wait forever","Over here! Stay closer, please","You're falling behind - stay where we can see you","Come ON, come on, keep up!","HEY!! Pick it up, you're gonna get us killed!","Hurry, hurry, we can't wait!","Where are you?! Keep UP!","Don't fall behind, please, don't fall behind!","Wait- wait- someone's lagging!","Hurry up, hurry up, you're too far back!","Hey! Hey, keep up, we're not waiting forever, come ON!","Where are you?! Hurry up, you're falling behind!","We can't stop here, move it, move it!","Come on, come on, I don't want to leave you out here alone!","Wait for you? No, no, you wait for US, keep up!","Somebody go back for them, they're slow, God, hurry up","Catch up!! They'll hear us if we shout, so hurry!","Come on, come on, we can't wait, we can't wait!","Where are you? Hurry up, we're leaving without you!","Don't dawdle, there's no time!","Hey!! Catch up!! Please!!","Faster, faster, they'll find us if we're slow","Why are you so far back? Close it up!","Hurry, hurry, we're exposed here!"}},
{"PARTY_LAG","reg=law,swat",{"Close it up, {name}, you're too far back","Pick up the pace","Move up!","Close the gap!","Keep pace!","Pick up the pace, you're dragging us down","Keep up, we're not stopping for stragglers","Move your ass, deputy, we've got a schedule","You're falling behind, move it","Pick it up, we're sitting ducks"}},
