{"PARTY_LAG","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Hey, {name}! Move your ass!","We ain't waiting all day - get over here","Keep up or get left","Hey, slowpoke, hustle!","Come ON, ya lazy bastard!","Hurry up, slowpoke, we ain't waiting for you!","Get your ass over here, you're holding us up","Move, damn it, we don't have all day","Hustle, slowpoke","Don't make me come back for you, I'll kick your ass","Move your ass, lazy"}},
{"PARTY_LAG","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Hurry up!! Please hurry, I don't like being this far from you!","Wait- wait- someone's far behind, someone's not keeping up!","Please don't be left behind, please hurry"}},
