{"PARTY_LEAVE_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Aw, alright... you were good company, {name}, I'll miss you","Go safe, if you ever need us, you know where we camp","Aw, hell, I'll miss having you around, go careful, alright","Go on, then... and if it all goes to hell, you know where we are","Yeah, go on, we'll manage, we'll be right here if you come back","You're LEAVING?! Ah, damn it... fine, go, just don't die on me","Go on, then, and if things go bad, you know where we are","Damn, we'll miss you, we really will, take some water with you at least","Go with God then... I'll pray for you, I will","It was nice having you, really, come back if you can","I'll miss your terrible jokes, I will","Take care, and don't forget us, we won't forget you","Fine, we'll make do, we always have","Just promise me you'll write, wait, there's no mail, never mind","Safe travels, and if you see my brother, tell him I'm alive","It's been good knowing you, really, take care, take care","I'll light a candle for you, I'm not even religious, but I will","Come back and tell us stories, if you can","Go on, we'll manage, we always do, somehow"}},
